    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c5de36d4-eb98-5b31-b947-71079db20fae" activityNameId="49005d59-8af2-579e-8f10-ff6e437f840e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe, future</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe, future
The module reflects a hybrid solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) micro gas turbine system with 180 kW electrical output. Inventory based on information from literature and one manufacturer. Life time operation of auxiliary systems is 80'000 h. Stack lifetime is 48'000 h. Lifetime of the micro gas turbine is 50'000 h.;
Synonyms: solid oxide fuel cell hybrid cycle power system, SOFC gas turbine hybrid, SOFC Gasturbinen Hybridsystem, Festoxid Brennstoffzellen Gasturbinen Hybridsystem; 
UUID: c2827bba-837f-3ef4-bfc8-04677fe9493b
The module includes the most important materials used for production, the energy needed for production, planning and engineering. Also included is the transport of the raw materials, the engine delivery and the installation on site.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Hybrid system combining a 125 kWe solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) with tubular stack design and a 55kWe micro gas turbine. For central cogeneration use. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 58%, total efficiency 80%.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c2827bba-837f-3ef4-bfc8-04677fe9493b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
